VALUES (547565, 'tt9731534', NULL, 'The Night House', 'The Night House', 'movie', 2021, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqs2CXpc4d5FzeP1EZCYItAVo81.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qbQ219gsHpdx33WSfdCgG9I2Xg5.jpg', 'Reeling from the unexpected death of her husband, Beth is left alone in the lakeside home he built for her. She tries as best she can to keep it together — but then nightmares come. Disturbing visions of a presence in the house calling to her, beckoning her with a ghostly allure. Against the advice of her friends, she begins digging into her husband''s belongings, yearning for answers. What she finds are secrets both strange and disturbing — a mystery she''s determined to unravel.', NULL, NULL, 3.6192, 6.5, 0, 6.0383333333333331e+00, '2026-07-30 18:28:39', '2026-11-18 07:38:05')
